	(text "+3V3 comes from the FireBeetle regulator (PWR_FLAG). BT3 plugs into the FireBeetle's own\nbattery socket (J3 is that socket, not a separate part)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 251.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6b752251-5674-41b4-ac15-cdeca9d95cb1")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n- Valve GPIOs come from CONFIG_DYNAMIC_VALVE_GPIO_LIST = 1,14,18,21,22,16,17,5\n  (valves 1-8, CONFIG_DEVICE_MAX_VALVES = 8). All 8 relay channels are valves.\n- GPIO 16/17 are UART0: the console runs on USB Serial/JTAG.\n- No safe GPIO is left: more valves, the 24 VAC converter enable,\n  mains-detect and battery sense need an I2C expander / I2C ADC.\n- Relay contacts are not in the relay module symbol: J2 pin 1 -> COM1..8,\n  NO1..8 -> valves 1..8, J2 pin 2 -> valve common.\n- Power: J1 takes +24 V DC from the off-board PSU and floats BT1+BT2 (via the J11 fuse, U2).\n  U1 makes +5V. U3 makes 24 VAC for the valves. Mains-detect, battery sense\n  and U3 EN need the I2C expander / ADC (TBD); EN is unconnected for now.\n- IO6/IO7: UART1 link to A3 ESP32-S3 (A3 IO17 TX -> IO7, IO6 -> A3 IO18 RX).\n  J4 taps the same wires.\n- RS-485 to the sensor cluster (J5: 1=A 2=B 3=+5V out 4=GND): U4 on UART, IO9 TX -> DI,\n  IO8 <- RO, DE and /RE on IO15 (on-board LED, shows TX). R7 holds DE low at boot.\n  JP1 fits the 120R terminator; R8/R9 390R bias sits at this end only.\n- The I2C bus uses header pins 28/29; pins 9/10 are the same signals.\n- No I2C device on this board yet: IO19/IO20 are for the I2C expander / ADC. Fit pull-ups with it.\n- SHT41, BMP581 and the solar panel are on the sensor cluster, read over RS-485 (J5).\n- 1.8k/3.3k dividers scale the 0-5 V sensor outputs to 0-3.24 V.\n- Wire colours: 24 VAC magenta, +24V DC red, +5V orange, +3V3 blue, GND black.\n- A3 ESP32-S3 runs from +5V (DevKit 5V0 pin).\n- J6 LCD2004 I2C (1=GND 2=VCC 3=SDA 4=SCL) on A3: IO8 SDA, IO9 SCL, VCC from A3 3V3 pin 1.\n- LCD keys SW2-SW5 and R12-R14 are on the external key panel (J7: 1=KEYS 2=GND), a resistor ladder\n  into A3 IO4 (ADC1 ch3). R15 10k pull-up to A3 3V3. SW2 WAKE/OK 0 V, SW3 UP 0.60 V, SW4 DOWN 1.18 V,\n  SW5 BACK 1.98 V, no key 3.30 V. A3 IO5-IO7 are free.\n- Sensor cable TVS: D3 DS18B20, D4 XDB401, D5 wind OUT, D6 wind +24V. R11 limits IO4 current.\n- Not drawn yet: the switch that turns A9 off on battery, I2C expander / ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 76.2 0)
